    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a short walking simulator with a first-person view, emphasizing on narrative, exploration and horror elements, as well as a deep psychological component. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style graphics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793890/extras/7980fdeca96d27d8c519985dff90e002.poster.avif?t=1755507032\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793890/extras/7980fdeca96d27d8c519985dff90e002.webm?t=1755507032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793890/extras/7980fdeca96d27d8c519985dff90e002.mp4?t=1755507032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immerse yourself in an atmospheric setting as you explore a small village and abandoned mines.</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark plot:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793890/extras/c6cfaae25787887c99fc435e403202d6.poster.avif?t=1755507032\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793890/extras/c6cfaae25787887c99fc435e403202d6.webm?t=1755507032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793890/extras/c6cfaae25787887c99fc435e403202d6.mp4?t=1755507032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reality or phantasmagoria? Find out what secrets a simple rural life can hide.</i> </p><ul 